::  modules/caravan/glow/gate-vault-lease.glow -- Ephemeral key lease!
/!  16384
|%
++  gate-vault-lease
  |=  [now-epoch=@ud valid-until=@ud]                   ::  TTL custody check
  ^-  @ud                                               ::  remaining epochs
  ~|  'vault-lease-expired-zeroize-now'                 ::  Scorpio erasure!
  ?>  (lth now-epoch valid-until)                       ::  strictly active
  (sub valid-until now-epoch)
--
